  "transcriptSegments": [
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "speaker": "Chelsea Rathbun",
      "content": "We're going to start with the product proposals board review.",
      "startedAtMs": 45000,
      "endedAtMs": 50000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 8
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "speaker": "Chelsea Rathbun",
      "content": "We have some new proposals that have no status. Does anyone want to claim them?",
      "startedAtMs": 65000,
      "endedAtMs": 72000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 9
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "speaker": "Ali Hugo",
      "content": "I need to take a look at my capacity and core contributor hours before I volunteer for anything.",
      "startedAtMs": 115000,
      "endedAtMs": 124000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "speaker": "Sarina Canelake",
      "content": "I have a slight concern around capacity. We already have twelve proposals in review, two new, and eleven on hold.",
      "startedAtMs": 145000,
      "endedAtMs": 157000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 17
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "speaker": "Chelsea Rathbun",
      "content": "I generally agree in terms of limiting work in progress. Maybe we focus on tackling items already in review first.",
      "startedAtMs": 205000,
      "endedAtMs": 216000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "speaker": "Ali Hugo",
      "content": "There are disagreements about how many items a clipboard can hold. I'm not sure how to proceed with a disagreement like that.",
      "startedAtMs": 350000,
      "endedAtMs": 362000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 51
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "speaker": "Chelsea Rathbun",
      "content": "Do we have user research about whether this causes confusion? Testing could show how it should be implemented.",
      "startedAtMs": 375000,
      "endedAtMs": 388000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 52
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "We can build user discovery into the first phase: designs followed by usability feedback. We don't have to decide the item limit now.",
      "startedAtMs": 420000,
      "endedAtMs": 436000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 55
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "speaker": "Glib Glugovskiy",
      "content": "It would be good to do a proper UX review and user testing first, then move to the final implementation idea.",
      "startedAtMs": 500000,
      "endedAtMs": 512000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 59
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "I would move the clipboard proposal to backlog.",
      "startedAtMs": 620000,
      "endedAtMs": 624000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 69
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "There may be value in breaking the backlog into a more nuanced status: projects that are funded and projects that are not.",
      "startedAtMs": 675000,
      "endedAtMs": 688000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "speaker": "Sarina Canelake",
      "content": "On deck sounds like it already has a team and is next for development.",
      "startedAtMs": 730000,
      "endedAtMs": 738000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 80
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "Maybe the status should be 'approved, needs resourcing'.",
      "startedAtMs": 755000,
      "endedAtMs": 760000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 84
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000014",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "speaker": "Santiago Suarez",
      "content": "I like 'please work on it'. It is simple, understandable, and acts as a call to action.",
      "startedAtMs": 780000,
      "endedAtMs": 789000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 91
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000015",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "I'll take an action item to break this out for the next meeting.",
      "startedAtMs": 795000,
      "endedAtMs": 801000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 92
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000016",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "speaker": "Chelsea Rathbun",
      "content": "When a product proposal is accepted, should it be added to the community release plan as a new row?",
      "startedAtMs": 980000,
      "endedAtMs": 990000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 122
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000017",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "Proposals should go on the sheet only if they are resourced and we know who the team is.",
      "startedAtMs": 1030000,
      "endedAtMs": 1039000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 124
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "We can add a placeholder during review, then update it during the monthly release-planning cycle.",
      "startedAtMs": 1095000,
      "endedAtMs": 1104000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 130
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000019",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "speaker": "Glib Glugovskiy",
      "content": "Editors should use personal filter views so view-only users can still see the complete planning horizon.",
      "startedAtMs": 1230000,
      "endedAtMs": 1241000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 140
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000020",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "speaker": "Cassie Zamparini",
      "content": "I've been working on the product review process and cleaning it up. I'll run through it briefly.",
      "startedAtMs": 1450000,
      "endedAtMs": 1458000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 153
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "speaker": "Cassie Zamparini",
      "content": "I tried to keep it concise while putting as much information as possible into one document, so we have one source of truth.",
      "startedAtMs": 1530000,
      "endedAtMs": 1544000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 157
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "speaker": "Ali Hugo",
      "content": "This is much better. It looks much easier to follow.",
      "startedAtMs": 1580000,
      "endedAtMs": 1586000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 160
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000023",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "speaker": "Sarina Canelake",
      "content": "I didn't really understand all the labels and statuses. It would be good to build consensus around what they mean.",
      "startedAtMs": 1760000,
      "endedAtMs": 1772000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 174
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000024",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "This is a good opportunity to align and simplify the labels as much as possible.",
      "startedAtMs": 1810000,
      "endedAtMs": 1817000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000025",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "The action item is to review the labels, align them with current roadmap usage, and simplify from there.",
      "startedAtMs": 1920000,
      "endedAtMs": 1930000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 189
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000026",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "speaker": "Glib Glugovskiy",
      "content": "How should the product working group be involved in the Open edX Marketplace proposal?",
      "startedAtMs": 2050000,
      "endedAtMs": 2059000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 193
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000027",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "speaker": "Jenna Makowski",
      "content": "Please present the proposal to this group. We need to align it with the XBlock and LTI configuration projects.",
      "startedAtMs": 2180000,
      "endedAtMs": 2192000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 199
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "speaker": "Glib Glugovskiy",
      "content": "I can prepare a more detailed presentation focused on product categories and how the Marketplace should be populated.",
      "startedAtMs": 2240000,
      "endedAtMs": 2251000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 201
    },
    {
      "id": "40000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000029",
      "roomId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
      "participantId": "20000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "speaker": "Glib Glugovskiy",
      "content": "Tutor plugins may be the main extension mechanism. The product group can help categorize and describe modules so the Marketplace is usable for the community.",
      "startedAtMs": 2470000,
      "endedAtMs": 2486000,
      "isFinal": true,
      "sourceParagraph": 206
    }
  ],
